sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PI as Raspberry Pi
  participant MQ as Mosquitto
  participant MC as mqtt/client.ts
  participant VL as schema.ts (zod)
  participant Q as KeyedQueue<br/>ingest.ts
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as lib/ws.ts
  participant FE as Frontend<br/>WsContext

  PI->>MQ: PUBLISH bms/{id}/data (QoS 1)
  MQ->>MC: forward (sub bms/+/data)
  MC->>VL: parseBmsMessage()
  alt payload tidak valid
    VL-->>MC: reject (log, dibuang)
  else valid
    VL-->>MC: payload tervalidasi
    MC->>Q: enqueueIngest(deviceId)
    Q->>DB: transaksi: upsert Device/Pack/Cell<br/>+ createMany History
    DB-->>Q: sukses
    Q->>WS: broadcast("bms:update")
    WS-->>FE: event ke client tersambung
    FE->>FE: update UI
  end
  Note over WS,FE: Planned: auth WebSocket<br/>+ filter per owner/kolaborator
